<view class="warm-page warm-page--form warm-state-host warm-submit-state entry-page"><brand-scene title="食光知味" subtitle="饭饭主厨已经为你打开厨房门" character="welcome" /><view class="entry-form"><text class="entry-form__title">进入今天的餐桌</text><text class="entry-form__note">登录后将根据账户权限自动进入对应工作区。</text><label class="entry-field"><text>账户</text><input type="text" value="{{form.username}}" placeholder="请输入账户" bindinput="onUsernameInput" /></label><label class="entry-field"><view class="entry-field__head"><text>密码</text><text class="entry-recovery" bindtap="openPasswordRecovery" aria-role="button" aria-label="找回密码">忘记密码</text></view><input password value="{{form.password}}" placeholder="请输入密码" bindinput="onPasswordInput" /></label><text class="entry-login-hint">无需选择身份，系统会自动识别并调整界面。</text><view class="entry-actions"><action-button label="{{loading ? '登录中...' : '登录'}}" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" block bind:action="submitLogin" /><action-button label="注册新账户" tone="secondary" block bind:action="openRegister" /></view></view></view>
